    "cid": "1581",
    "title": "幕后筹备",
    "category": 5,
    "header": "幕后筹备",
    "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"5387ab13fe487442b7a8d15a569af94b\" title=\"关于新舞台的布置.png\" alt=\"关于新舞台的布置.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/5387ab13fe487442b7a8d15a569af94b.png\"/></div><p></p><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        场地很合心意，</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        但陈设稍显不足，</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        请管家多调配些资源过来，</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        只需数月，便能请主演上台。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        ——匿名剧团成员</span></span></em></span></h5><p></p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-left\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"ed0e37d01608f27d7b00b2c79e244e2f\" title=\"幕后筹备.png\" alt=\"幕后筹备.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/ed0e37d01608f27d7b00b2c79e244e2f.png\"/></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">尽管每次探险都是一次无法回头的冒险，</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">但在多次探险中累计的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【昏暗的灵感】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">,</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以用于在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【幕后筹备】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中点亮加成节点，</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">为之后的古堡探索提供永久助力。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*仅对</span><span style=\"color:#cd3939\">「傀影与猩红孤钻」</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">常规行动生效</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"e749d73f0dbdf9cef592ba06669142fc\" alt=\"分割线1.png\" title=\"分割线1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211228/e749d73f0dbdf9cef592ba06669142fc.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"3f4f02f765c42d56d5a4f3217b5f3964\" title=\"5.png\" alt=\"5.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/3f4f02f765c42d56d5a4f3217b5f3964.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【当前加成总览】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中，您可以查看目前正在生效的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【幕后筹备】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">总加成。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">通过对</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【幕后筹备】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点的升级，将有一系列的加成条目被激活。以当前条目为例，当加成总览中的分数转换蜡烛为+16％时，结算时</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【幕后筹备】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">给予的倍率为1.16倍。</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" title=\"分隔栏小.png\" alt=\"分隔栏小.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"13cf1708798f82685b5f3572594de1b1\" title=\"6.png\" alt=\"6.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/13cf1708798f82685b5f3572594de1b1.png\"/></div><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\"></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" title=\"分隔栏小.png\" alt=\"分隔栏小.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"afe966741c1e1de78182ddb36b59f38d\" title=\"7.png\" alt=\"7.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220624/afe966741c1e1de78182ddb36b59f38d.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">升级</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【幕后筹备】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的节点需要消耗</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【昏暗的灵感】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在累计蜡烛提升古堡笔记等级时，笔记每累积获得10蜡烛，将同时获得1昏暗的灵感。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当已获得足够升级所有幕后筹备节点的</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【昏暗的灵感】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">时，你将不会再继续获得</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【昏暗的灵感】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><h6 style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*图片仅供参考</span></span></h6>",
    "displayTime": "2022-01-05",
